SUMMARY:Alumni Reunion 2026
DESCRIPTION:Back where it all began. First time away from home\, first all-nighter\, first aha moment in a lecture hall. U of T was a time of new experiences and every spring\, thousands of grads come back for more. We can’t wait to share laughs and create new memories with you. Join us for U of T Alumni Reunion 2026! \nJune 14 – June 20\, 2026\n \nMost U of T Engineering activities will take place on Saturday\, June 20. See our main Alumni Reunion webpage for details on all our events.
URL:https://www.engineering.utoronto.ca/event/alumni-reunion-2026/
CATEGORIES:Alumni events,Socials
